{"key": "c61a66160dc5da293be091622cfe7489", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "**Ontem (03/11/2026)** você teve 3 vendas aprovadas, num total de **R$ 695,50**:\n- Pix: 1 venda, R$ 120,00\n- Crédito: 1 venda, R$ 480,00\n- Débito: 1 venda, R$ 95,50\n\nNão houve recusas ontem.\n\nSobre o número de parcelas do crediário, não tenho essa informação nos seus dados. Essa parte fica com outro especialista.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgiBC17uv38tH4SXERxs7", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 757}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 757, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4020, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 160, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-01#0"}
{"key": "24621a852cd784a3508ac28125b66e09", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Pela PTAX do Banco Central do Brasil (boletim de fechamento de 04/11/2026), 1 euro vale R$ 6,1531 na compra e R$ 6,1549 na venda. Sobre vender pelo WhatsApp com o Link de Pagamento, não tenho essa informação aqui, então não consigo confirmar. Se quiser, posso consultar suas vendas, seus recebimentos ou suas maquininhas ([policy:capabilities]).", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgiBC3EupGM62v9E6DRGE", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 427}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 427, "cache_read_input_tokens": 8976, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 163, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-03#0"}
{"key": "ba96bbe8608caccc019ce7238c33dbd6", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Terminal T1988B (Get Clássica) is offline. Here is what the lookup shows:\n- It connects by chip and has no signal.\n- Its last contact was 04/11/2026 at 08:07.\n- It has been offline for 5 hours.\n\nTerminal T1988A (Get Smart) is online on Wi-Fi with good signal.\n\nI can propose a support ticket for T1988B because it has no signal. The ticket would only be proposed until you confirm it. Do you want me to do that?\n\nI'm handling only the terminal part of your message here. The crediário installments question isn't covered by your account data.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgiBC1R215u5ppnRo4PRB", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 446}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 446, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3881, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 196, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
{"key": "d3e807d258f646594fdf188c8e6c7f9c", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Sim, dá para vender pelo WhatsApp com o Link de Pagamento. A página do produto diz que você pode fazer vendas usando o WhatsApp ou sua rede social [1]. A página de dúvidas confirma que o vendedor pode enviar o link por redes sociais, WhatsApp, e-mail e SMS. Depois, o cliente clica no link, escolhe o método de pagamento e finaliza a compra [2]. Você pode deixar o comprador escolher entre débito, crédito, Pix, Wallet e boleto [3].\n\nA cotação do euro não é parte que eu possa responder aqui.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgiBC4yaxr3J9N2H7Kq16", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 5878}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5878, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 212, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-03#0"}
{"key": "e3adfc195ac573b55ee1540ce3417935", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "O Crediário permite parcelar em até 48x no cartão de crédito. O prazo máximo e a taxa de juros variam de acordo com o emissor do cartão [3]. Cada emissor define o limite de parcelas conforme suas políticas de crédito [1].\n\nPara saber os juros que o cliente pagará, faça a simulação na maquininha. Insira o cartão, informe o valor e escolha crédito > crediário. A simulação serve só para consulta, e o emissor aprova a transação na contratação [1].\n\nQuanto ao que você vendeu ontem, outro especialista cuida dessa parte.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgiBC6GEbRDyDGrE4LTtj", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 5413}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5413, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 206, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-01#0"}
{"key": "026ca59ca523a21785a93940532719fa", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Crediário can be split into up to 48x, according to the Getnet crediário page [2]. That page marks the figure with an asterisk, and the passages don't explain what the asterisk means. The card issuer sets the actual installment limit under its own credit policies [5].\n\nYou can see the interest your customer would pay by running a simulation on the terminal. Insert the card, enter the amount, then choose credit > crediário [5]. The simulation is for reference only. It is subject to credit analysis, and the issuer decides whether to approve the transaction [5].", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgiBCAxkoaSLKyDSNfqfD", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 5352}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5352, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 175, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
