{"key": "9205067a21b57e6041555cf9a03ff5a2", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "It depends on the account, and the sources don't say a traditional bank account is required. They do describe the Get Conta, a free digital business account where you can send and receive money and sell through Pix [9]. Pix in general works with a checking, savings or prepaid payment account [1]. Getnet's machine page also lists a free account and card alongside Pix payments [5]. You can take Pix sales through the Get Tap phone app or a QR Code on the machine [8].\n\nThe sources don't say whether you can receive Pix sales without any account at all, or whether Getnet requires the Get Conta specifically.\n\nMISSING: whether an account (Get Conta or another) is mandatory to receive Pix sales", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CgiBECfViJ2uUUTY6ryZi", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 1616}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1616, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5886, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 221, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-04#0"}
